---@field createTime? string Output only. Create a time stamp.
---@field interactiveSerialConsoleEnabled? boolean Output only. True if the interactive serial console feature is enabled for the instance, false otherwise. The default value is false.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Update a time stamp.
---@field logicalInterfaces? gcp.baremetalsolution_v2.GoogleCloudBaremetalsolutionV2LogicalInterfaceList List of logical interfaces for the instance. The number of logical interfaces will be the same as number of hardware bond/nic on the chosen network template. For the non-multivlan configurations (for eg, existing servers) that use existing default network template (bondaa-bondaa), both the Instance.networks field and the Instance.logical_interfaces fields will be filled to ensure backward compatibility. For the others, only Instance.logical_interfaces will be filled.
---@field machineType? string Immutable. The server type. [Available server types](https://cloud.google.com/bare-metal/docs/bms-planning#server_configurations)
---@field networks? gcp.baremetalsolution_v2.NetworkList Output only. List of networks associated with this server.
---@field sshKeys? gcp.baremetalsolution_v2.StringList Optional. List of SSH Keys used during instance provisioning.
---@field workloadProfile? gcp.baremetalsolution_v2.InstanceWorkloadProfileEnum|string The workload profile for the instance.
---@field state? gcp.baremetalsolution_v2.InstanceStateEnum|string Output only. The state of the server.
---@field labels? gcp.baremetalsolution_v2.StringMap Labels as key value pairs.
