---@field name string Immutable. The resource name of this `Instance`. Resource names are schemeless URIs that follow the conventions in https://cloud.google.com/apis/design/resource_names. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/instances/{instance}`
---@field updateMask? string The list of fields to update. The currently supported fields are: `labels` `hyperthreading_enabled` `os_image` `ssh_keys` `kms_key_version`

