---@field protocol? gcp.baremetalsolution_v2.VolumeConfigProtocolEnum|string Volume protocol.
---@field machineIds? gcp.baremetalsolution_v2.StringList Machine ids connected to this volume. Set only when protocol is PROTOCOL_FC.
---@field name? string Output only. The name of the volume config.
---@field gcpService? string The GCP service of the storage volume. Available gcp_service are in https://cloud.google.com/bare-metal/docs/bms-planning.
---@field snapshotsEnabled? boolean Whether snapshots should be enabled.

